  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade mission oilseeds and pulses to Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This mission aimed to establish a connection between the producers in Ethiopia and the importers in the Netherlands. Sesame has become a significant export product, and the oilseed sector in Ethiopia has great potential, including processing. The Netherlands Embassy has been actively involved in promoting this sector. Therefore, it is essential to strengthen the market linkages between Ethiopian producers and Dutch importers to benefit both parties.</narrative>
  </description>
